  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Description",
   "szText": "It was under a pale light that night when Spiritborn Perep found her friends, rounded up by brigands. Her gleaming glaive made no sound with each graceful slice, rending sinew and bonds alike. Thus did the Moon exact justice, and the Sun soon warmed the evildoers' corpses... ",
